# WROSE Sentinel Devvit Configuration
# Copy this file to .env and adjust values.
#
# NOTE: WROSE Sentinel now uses native Devvit analysis by default.
# The external WROSE backend is optional and requires Reddit-approved HTTP domains.
#
# WROSE_API_BASE_URL is optional. Leave empty for native-only mode.
#
# WROSE_API_BASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8000
#
# Reddit HTTP Fetch Domain Notes
# -----
# Personal HTTP fetch domains have been rejected by Reddit.
# WROSE Sentinel now works fully inside Reddit without external HTTP fetch.
# The external FastAPI backend (apps/api) remains the WROSE signal lab.
# See docs/PHASE_2I_NATIVE_DEVVIT_ADAPTER.md for architecture details.
